| **Switch threshold (`|θ| < 0.25`, `|θ̇| < 1.0`)** | Gives the PD controller a “head‑start” before the pendulum is perfectly vertical, so the energy term does not fight the PD term. The pendulum typically reaches this region with a modest angular speed, making the PD stage smoother. |
